{"seq":1,"slug":"physics-revolutions","title":"物理学革命","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"special-relativity","title":"狭义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/special-relativity","wordCount":1525,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"general-relativity","title":"广义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/general-relativity","wordCount":1473,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"mass-energy-equivalence","title":"质能等价 E=mc²","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/mass-energy-equivalence","wordCount":1338,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"物理学革命\">物理学革命</h1><p>在爱因斯坦之前，物理学有两座看似牢不可破的大厦：牛顿力学与麦克斯韦电磁学。问题在于，二者在&quot;运动&quot;这一点上互相矛盾——牛顿力学允许速度无限叠加，麦克斯韦方程却给出一个固定的光速。十九世纪末的物理学家试图用&quot;以太&quot;这种弥漫全空间的介质来调和，却始终找不到它存在的证据。</p>\n<p>爱因斯坦的解决方式近乎激进：他不修补旧理论，而是重新审视时间与空间这两个被认为理所当然的概念。1905 年的狭义相对论提出，光速对所有惯性观察者都相同，由此推出运动的钟会变慢、运动的尺会缩短、同时性是相对的。这一年稍晚，他又从狭义相对论中推出了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，揭示质量与能量是同一事物的两种表现。</p>\n<p>然而狭义相对论只处理匀速运动，无法容纳引力。爱因斯坦花了近十年时间，借助黎曼几何这一数学工具，于 1915 年完成广义相对论。它把引力理解为质量和能量造成的时空弯曲，并立即解释了困扰天文学家半个多世纪的水星近日点进动；1919 年的日食观测又证实了它对星光偏折的预言。</p>\n<p>本章的三篇文档分别讲述狭义相对论、广义相对论与质能等价，力图说明这两场革命各自要回答什么问题、给出了怎样的答案，以及它们如何被实验检验。</p>\n"}